    doc.append('| **2** | **ME Four-Chamber** | Mid-Esophagus | $0^\circ	ext{--}20^\circ$ | LA, LV, RA, RV, MV (P2, A2), TV | Biventricular size/function, MV and TV leaflets, IAS, pericardial effusion. |')
    doc.append('| **3** | **ME Mitral Commissural** | Mid-Esophagus | $45^\circ	ext{--}60^\circ$ | LA, LV, MV (P3, A2, P1), papillary muscles | Interrogates mitral commissures, distinguishes P1 vs P3 scallops, circumflex artery risk. |')
    doc.append('| **4** | **ME Two-Chamber** | Mid-Esophagus | $80^\circ	ext{--}100^\circ$ | LA, LV, LAA, MV (P3, A1-A3), CS | Anterior and inferior LV wall kinetics, LAA thrombus, transmitral inflow. |')
    doc.append('| **5** | **ME Long-Axis (LAX)** | Mid-Esophagus | $120^\circ	ext{--}140^\circ$ | LA, LV, LVOT, AV, proximal Ao, MV (P2, A2) | Anteroseptal and inferolateral LV walls, SAM risk ($C\text{--}Sept$ distance), AR/MR jets. |')
    doc.append('| **6** | **ME Aortic Valve LAX** | Mid-Esophagus | $110^\circ	ext{--}130^\circ$ | Aortic root, annulus, sinuses, STJ, right and noncoronary cusps | Annulus diameter, sinus of Valsalva sizing, STJ caliber, coronary ostial height. |')
    doc.append('| **7** | **ME Ascending Aorta LAX** | Mid-Esophagus | $100^\circ	ext{--}120^\circ$ | Tubular ascending aorta, RPA cross-section | Ascending aortic aneurysm, Type A dissection flap, atheroma grading. |')
    doc.append('| **8** | **ME Ascending Aorta SAX** | Mid-Esophagus | $0^\circ	ext{--}45^\circ$ | Circular ascending aorta, RPA bifurcation, SVC | SVC cannula position, RPA embolism, circular aortic dissection entry. |')
    doc.append('| **9** | **ME Right Pulmonary Vein**| Mid-Esophagus | $0^\circ	ext{--}30^\circ$ | RUPV, RLPV, SVC, RA | PWD of pulmonary venous flow (systolic flow reversal in severe MR). |')
