    doc.append('| **11** | **ME RV Inflow-Outflow** | Mid-Esophagus | $50^\circ	ext{--}70^\circ$ | RA, TV, RV, RVOT, Pulmonic valve, PA | TV and PV morphology, RVOT gradients, subvalvular pulmonic stenosis. |')
    doc.append('| **12** | **ME Modified Bicaval TV**| Mid-Esophagus | $50^\circ	ext{--}80^\circ$ | RA, TV, IVC, CS ostium | Tricuspid leaflet coaptation, pacemaker lead impingement, pacing wires. |')
    doc.append('| **13** | **ME Bicaval View** | Mid-Esophagus | $90^\circ	ext{--}110^\circ$ | RA, LA, SVC, IVC, Interatrial septum | ASD/PFO morphology, saline bubble contrast study, ECMO cannula guidance. |')
    doc.append('| **14** | **ME Left Pulmonary Veins** | Mid-Esophagus | $40^\circ	ext{--}60^\circ$ | LUPV, LLPV, LA, LAA | Pulmonary venous flow velocity profiles, anastomotic patency post-transplant. |')
    doc.append('| **15** | **ME LA Appendage** | Mid-Esophagus | $80^\circ	ext{--}100^\circ$ | LAA body, lobes, pectinate muscles, circumflex artery | LAA thrombus exclusion (PWD emptying velocity $< 20\text{ cm/s}$ = stasis), Watchman sizing. |')
