    doc.append('| **17** | **TG Midpapillary SAX** | Transgastric | $0^\circ$ | LV circular cross-section, anterolateral and posteromedial papillary muscles | 6-segment LV wall motion, ischemia monitoring in LAD/LCx/RCA territories, septal shift. |')
    doc.append('| **18** | **TG Apical SAX** | Transgastric | $0^\circ$ | Apical LV cavity, apical cap | Apical wall motion, apical thrombus, apical hypertrophic cardiomyopathy. |')
