    doc.append('| **21** | **Deep TG Five-Chamber** | Deep Transgastric | $0^\circ	ext{--}20^\circ$ | LV apex, LVOT, AV, ascending aorta | **Gold standard Doppler view for AS and LVOT gradients** (parallel beam-to-flow alignment). |')
    doc.append('| **22** | **TG Two-Chamber** | Transgastric | $80^\circ	ext{--}100^\circ$ | LV anterior and inferior walls, MV, subvalvular chordae | Chordal rupture, papillary muscle rupture, LV longitudinal shortening. |')
    doc.append('| **23** | **TG RV Inflow** | Transgastric | $90^\circ	ext{--}110^\circ$ | RA, TV, RV anterior and inferior walls | Tricuspid subvalvular chordal architecture, RV inferior wall kinetics. |')
