    doc.append('| **Aortic Valve & Root** | ME AV SAX ($30^\circ	ext{--}60^\circ$) or ME AV LAX ($120^\circ$) | 3D Zoom | Bicuspid morphotype, raphe identification, en face AVA planimetry, non-planar annular sizing. |')
    doc.append('| **Tricuspid Valve** | ME 4Ch ($0^\circ$) or ME RV Inflow-Outflow ($60^\circ$) | 3D Zoom & Full-Volume | Simultaneous visualization of anterior, posterior, and septal leaflets; pacemaker lead impingement. |')
